Package: scopingreview
Title: Automated Systematic and Scoping Literature Reviews via Scopus and OpenAlex
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Josh", "Tyler", email = "josh.tyler@bristol.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds Boolean search queries from topic keywords and optional
    geographic filters, retrieves records from the Elsevier Scopus and OpenAlex
    APIs, harmonises their metadata, removes duplicates using exact DOI and fuzzy
    title matching, and flags papers published in a curated list of political
    science, public administration and African studies journals.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/PPADEM/scopingreview
BugReports: https://github.com/PPADEM/scopingreview/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    openalexR,
    purrr,
    rscopus,
    stringdist,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    stats,
    utils
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
